    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you request an import quote we collect your name, phone or WhatsApp number, an optional email address, details of the vehicle and anything you write in the notes. When you request a vehicle update we collect your name, phone number, the VIN or tracking reference and your question.</p>
